    "title": "Medved sees a better Gopher team in year two - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Charles Hallman ,\n17 hours ago Niko Medved, now in his second year as head coach, has a Gopher squad that returns a core group of four players along with nine new additions for the 2026-27 season. “Guys have a great spirit about them,” Medved told MSR while sitting in his Stadium Village office overlooking the team’s practice court. “I think we have improved.” Read full article\n1",
